(rectangle (start 220.98 35.56) (end 339.09 60.96) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "b1fb5c42-31c9-524d-a4bf-cd21445bc4d5"))
(text "Sense resistor, low side, Kelvin (ADR 0017 item 4)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.25 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fb767a32-8578-55e8-96be-f6d49be946b8"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: BQ28Z610-R1 reads both cells (VC2 after the fuse, VC1 on the tap) and counts charge\n   on a 3 mΩ low-side sense resistor; the pack PCM protects and balances (ADR 0014, ADR 0017).\n2. Absent state: never omitted. Storage: Blackbird OS sends MAC 0x0010 twice, then the BQ25798\n   enters shutdown mode; the ship FET opens, PACK falls and the gauge shuts down (ADR 0017 item 3).\n3. VSS, PWPD and every gauge capacitor return to BAT_N, the cell side of the sense resistor;\n   SRP to the cell side, SRN to GND, each through 100 Ω, 100 nF at the pins (SLUSE07B Figure 9-1).\n4. CHG and DSG open (no FETs: SLUSE07B §8.3.14; TI E2E 903283, forum guidance).\n5. TS1: board NTC NCP15XH103F03RC against the pocket floor (BOM v1 line 48).\n6. Golden image, CC Gain calibration per board: ADR 0017 items 4-5." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 224.79 0) (size 129.54 24.13) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be918e79-659e-509f-ac1d-3053cfa28497"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a48742a9-6b38-5159-9a45-ef17d0726333"))
